; savannah_village_c.tres — Savannah village variant C.
; Compact circular arrangement: four small huts around a central firepit (torches+lanterns).
; Palette: brown (15) + wood_log natural pillars, tan (16) floors, lime (7) accent flowers.
; NPCs: 3 savannah-skin wandering builders.
; DOCS.md §2 — savannah village structure; CONTEXT.md D-07, D-09.

